# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# generated by tools/headless-sim/build_sim.py
tools/headless-sim/sim.luau

# Secrets. tools/monetization's DEFAULT credential is a .ROBLOSECURITY session
# COOKIE (--cookie-file / $ROBLOSECURITY_FILE) — a full account session, and the
# file belongs OUTSIDE this repo entirely. The Open Cloud key (ROBLOX_API_KEY) is
# the reads-only fallback and lives in the environment. These patterns are only a
# backstop for the habit of "just drop it in a file for a second"; they are not
# permission to keep either one here.
.env
.env.*
*.apikey
**/apikey*.txt
**/*secret*.txt
*ROBLOSECURITY*
**/cookie*.txt
**/*.cookie

# Python bytecode from tools/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
